76:["$","h2",null,{"className":"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2","id":"2-query-initiation-and-vectorization","children":[["$","a",null,{"data-card":"","href":"#2-query-initiation-and-vectorization","className":"peer","children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"2. Query Initiation and Vectorization"}]}],["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100","aria-label":"Link to section","children":[[["$","path","1cjeqo",{"d":"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"}],["$","path","19qd67",{"d":"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
77:["$","p",null,{"children":["$","$L8a",null,{"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 70vw, 900px","src":"language_model_images/Handling_Hallucination_8.png","alt":"png","className":"rounded-lg"}]}]
78:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Your query starts as a simple string of text. However, computers, particularly AI models, don’t understand text and its underlying meanings the same way humans do. To bridge this gap, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":["the RAG system converts your question into an ",["$","$Ld",null,{"href":"https://datasciencedojo.com/blog/embeddings-and-llm/","children":"embedding"}],", also known as a vector."]}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Why a vector, you might ask? Well, A vector is essentially a numerical representation of your query, capturing not just the words but the meaning behind them. This allows the system to search for answers based on concepts and ideas, not just matching keywords."}],"\n"]}]
79:["$","h2",null,{"className":"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2","id":"3-searching-the-vector-database","children":[["$","a",null,{"data-card":"","href":"#3-searching-the-vector-database","className":"peer","children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"3. Searching the Vector Database"}]}],["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100","aria-label":"Link to section","children":[[["$","path","1cjeqo",{"d":"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"}],["$","path","19qd67",{"d":"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
7a:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["With your query now in vector form, the RAG system seeks answers in an up-to-date vector database. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"The system looks for the vectors in this database that are closest to your query’s vector"}],"—the semantically similar ones, meaning they share the same underlying concepts or topics."]}],"\n"]}]
7b:["$","p",null,{"children":["$","$L8a",null,{"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 70vw, 900px","src":"language_model_images/Handling_Halluciination_9.png","alt":"png","className":"rounded-lg"}]}]
7c:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["But what exactly is a vector database?","\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Vector databases defined:"}]," A vector database stores vast amounts of information from diverse sources, such as the latest research papers, news articles, and scientific discoveries. However, it doesn’t store this information in traditional formats (like tables or text documents). Instead, each piece of data is converted into a vector during the ingestion process."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Why vectors?:"}]," This conversion to vectors allows the database to represent the data’s meaning and context numerically or into a language the computer can understand and comprehend deeply, beyond surface-level keywords."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Indexing:"}]," Once information is vectorized, it’s indexed within the database. Indexing organizes the data for rapid retrieval, much like an index in a textbook, enabling you to find the information you need quickly. This process ensures that the system can efficiently locate the most relevant information vectors when it searches for matches to your query vector."]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
7d:["$","h2",null,{"className":"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2","id":"4selecting-the-top-k-responses","children":[["$","a",null,{"data-card":"","href":"#4selecting-the-top-k-responses","className":"peer","children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"4.Selecting the Top ‘k’ Responses"}]}],["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100","aria-label":"Link to section","children":[[["$","path","1cjeqo",{"d":"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"}],["$","path","19qd67",{"d":"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
7e:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["From this search, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"the system selects the top few matches"}],"—let’s say the top 5. These matches are essentially pieces of information that best align with the essence of your question."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"By concentrating on the top matches, the RAG system ensures that the augmentation enriches your query with the most relevant and informative content, avoiding information overload and maintaining the response’s relevance and clarity."}],"\n"]}]
7f:["$","h2",null,{"className":"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2","id":"5augmenting-the-query","children":[["$","a",null,{"data-card":"","href":"#5augmenting-the-query","className":"peer","children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"5.Augmenting the Query"}]}],["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100","aria-label":"Link to section","children":[[["$","path","1cjeqo",{"d":"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"}],["$","path","19qd67",{"d":"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
80:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Next, the information from these top matches is used to augment the original query you asked the LLM. This doesn’t mean the system simply piles on data. Instead, it integrates key insights from these top matches to enrich the context for generating a response. This step is crucial because it ensures the model has a broader, more informed base from which to draw when crafting its answer."}],"\n"]}]
81:["$","h2",null,{"className":"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2","id":"6generating-the-response","children":[["$","a",null,{"data-card":"","href":"#6generating-the-response","className":"peer","children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"6.Generating the Response"}]}],["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100","aria-label":"Link to section","children":[[["$","path","1cjeqo",{"d":"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"}],["$","path","19qd67",{"d":"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
82:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Now comes the final step: generating a response. With the augmented query, the model is ready to reply. It doesn’t just output the retrieved information verbatim. Instead, it synthesizes the enriched data into a coherent, natural-language answer.For your renewable energy question, the model might generate a summary highlighting the most recent and impactful breakthrough, perhaps detailing a new solar panel technology that significantly increases power output. This answer is informative, up-to-date, and directly relevant to your query."}],"\n"]}]
83:["$","h3",null,{"className":"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2","id":"rag-pipeline-explore","children":[["$","a",null,{"data-card":"","href":"#rag-pipeline-explore","className":"peer","children":"RAG pipeline Explore"}],["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100","aria-label":"Link to section","children":[[["$","path","1cjeqo",{"d":"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"}],["$","path","19qd67",{"d":"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
